<title>USA: DeSoto Park, Texas, won by Smith Barney.</title>
<headline>DeSoto Park, Texas, won by Smith Barney.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Smith Barney Inc said it won $3 million of DeSoto Park Development Corp, Texas, sales tax revenue bonds, Series 1997, with a true interest cost of 5.30 percent.</p>
</text>
